---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const demoUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'book-a-demo/'
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + '/book-a-demo/';
---

<Layout
  title="About Ceres Technology | AI Planning Engine for Enterprise Supply Chains"
  description="Ceres Technology builds AI planning software that helps enterprise teams reconcile ERP records, demand signals, and external events into decision-ready supply chain plans."
>
  <main id="main" class="pt-14">

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface px-6 py-24 lg:px-12 lg:py-32">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_80%_20%,rgba(255,182,145,0.07),transparent_40%)]"></div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <span class="section-label mb-4">Company</span>
        <h1 class="mb-6 font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none max-w-4xl">
          We built Ceres to help enterprises turn outside chaos into usable decisions.
        </h1>
        <p class="mb-10 font-body font-normal text-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-prose leading-[1.7]">
          Ceres was founded by operators who saw firsthand how hard it was to connect real-world events to the records and systems businesses rely on every day. We built Ceres to close that gap.
        </p>
        <a href={demoUrl} class="btn-primary">
          Book a Demo
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OUR STORY -->
    <section class="border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-20 lg:px-12">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <span class="section-label">Our Story</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 mb-12 font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface">Built from a real operating problem</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
          <div class="text-base font-body text-on-surface-variant space-y-4 leading-[1.7]">
            <p>Ceres was born out of sheer frustration. Founders Bobby Katoli and Trey Hoobler were managing complex coffee supply chains when the COVID-19 pandemic hit.</p>
            <p>They quickly realized that while they had plenty of internal data—ERP records, spreadsheets, historical logs—they had zero connected context regarding real-world disruptions affecting their shipments.</p>
            <p>The realization was simple but profound: businesses don't lack records; they lack the situational awareness to act on those records before it's too late.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card relative h-64 lg:h-72 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
            <img loading="lazy" width="512" height="512" alt="Industrial supply chain shipping containers" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40 mix-blend-luminosity" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/about-hero.jpg`} />
            <div class="relative z-10 text-center p-4 border border-outline-variant/30 bg-surface/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
              <span class="section-label block mb-1">INCIDENT_LOG_2020</span>
              <span class="font-mono font-normal text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface">SUPPLY_CHAIN_DISRUPTION_DETECTED</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WHAT WE BELIEVE -->
    <section class="border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface px-6 py-20 lg:px-12">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <span class="section-label">What We Believe</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 mb-3 font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface">Better decisions come from better context</h2>
        <p class="mb-12 font-body font-normal text-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl leading-[1.7]">Organizations suffer from a shortage of connected context, not a shortage of records. We build systems that bridge this gap.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="card p-8 border-l-2 border-l-outline-variant">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-on-surface">The Old Way</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Relying on stale, disconnected spreadsheets and delayed reporting. Reacting to events after they have already impacted the bottom line.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-featured p-8">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-primary">The Ceres Way</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Ceres pipes live external context into your existing workflows so you can act before problems hit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SYSTEM CAPABILITIES + OPERATING PRINCIPLES -->
    <section class="border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-20 lg:px-12">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
        <div>
          <span class="section-label">System Capabilities</span>
          <h2 class="mt-4 mb-10 font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface text-3xl lg:text-4xl">What the platform does</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
            <div class="card p-4 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors cursor-default">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline">fact_check</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface">SCORECARDS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card p-4 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors cursor-default">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline">map</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface">EXPOSURE MAPPING</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card p-4 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors cursor-default">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline">category</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface">CLASSIFICATION</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card p-4 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors cursor-default">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline">trending_up</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface">FORECASTING</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card p-4 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors cursor-default">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline">science</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface">SCENARIO ANALYSIS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card p-4 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors cursor-default">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">monitoring</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface">OPERATIONAL MONITORING</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="section-label">Operating Principles</span>
          <h2 class="mt-4 mb-10 font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface text-3xl lg:text-4xl">How we work</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="card p-5 flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-primary data-mono">01</span>
              <p class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em]">Work with what already exists</p>
            </li>
            <li class="card p-5 flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-primary data-mono">02</span>
              <p class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em]">Focus on the workflow</p>
            </li>
            <li class="card p-5 flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-primary data-mono">03</span>
              <p class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em]">Make outputs easier to explain</p>
            </li>
            <li class="card p-5 flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-primary data-mono">04</span>
              <p class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em]">Reduce the manual grind</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card-featured p-6 mt-8">
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-on-surface">Who It's For</h3>
            <p class="font-body font-normal text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Teams where a missed signal has real consequences.</p>
            <div class="mt-4 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container-lowest text-[11px] text-outline font-mono tracking-[0.1em] border border-outline-variant/50">MANUFACTURING</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container-lowest text-[11px] text-outline font-mono tracking-[0.1em] border border-outline-variant/50">HEALTHCARE</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container-lowest text-[11px] text-outline font-mono tracking-[0.1em] border border-outline-variant/50">LOGISTICS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LEADERSHIP -->
    <section class="border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface px-6 py-20 lg:px-12">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <span class="section-label">Leadership</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 mb-12 font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface">Command Staff</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bobbykatoli/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card p-6 hover:border-primary transition-colors flex items-center justify-between group">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-on-surface mb-1">Bobby Katoli</h3>
              <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant">Co-Founder &amp; CEO</p>
            </div>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">arrow_outward</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/george-william-hoobler-iii-trey-a57bb17/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card p-6 hover:border-primary transition-colors flex items-center justify-between group">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-on-surface mb-1">Trey Hoobler</h3>
              <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant">Co-Founder</p>
            </div>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">arrow_outward</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/carlosamaral/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card p-6 hover:border-primary transition-colors flex items-center justify-between group">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-on-surface mb-1">Carlos Amaral</h3>
              <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant">EVP &amp; CIO</p>
            </div>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">arrow_outward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="cta-section text-center">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        <h2 class="mb-5 font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-[1.05]">Want to see how Ceres could fit your team?</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mb-10 font-body font-normal text-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl leading-[1.7]">See how Ceres connects your data to the signals your team actually needs.</p>
        <a href={demoUrl} class="btn-primary">
          Book a Demo
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
